OL,3,ADeadly shark attack prompts rare kill
OL,4,Aorder in Western Australia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident, at Sorrento Beach in
OL,7,FPerth's north, has reignited debate
OL,8,Fabout how to keep beachgoers safe in
OL,9,FAustralia.
